"description":"Identify any seed instantly with the power of AI. Whether you are a professional farmer, a curious gardener, or a botany student, Seedly turns your smartphone into a high-precision seed recognition tool.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nJust take a clear photo of any seed. Our advanced neural network analyzes the morphology to provide an instant match. No more guessing what is in that unmarked packet—get the data you need to grow with confidence.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n- Visual Identification: Instant recognition of thousands of seed species including vegetables, flowers, trees, and crops.\n- Detailed Growth Guides: Access critical information on soil pH, sunlight needs, watering schedules, and planting depth.\n- Germination Tracking: Learn exactly how long it takes for your specific seeds to sprout and the ideal temperatures for success.\n- Habitat Information: Understand native environments and the best zones for your plants to thrive.\n- Personal Collection: Save your identified seeds into a digital library to track your gardening journey.\n\nWHY SEEDLY?\nTraditional plant identification apps focus on leaves and flowers. Seedly is specialized for the very beginning of the life cycle. We bridge the gap between discovery and harvest, providing the technical botanical data required for successful agriculture and home gardening.\n\nPerfect for:\n- Gardeners wanting to organize their seed stash.\n- Farmers identifying crop variations.\n- Students and Botanists conducting field research.\n- Educators teaching plant biology.\n\nDownload Seedly and unlock the secrets of every seed today.\n\n\nFree vs Premium\n• Free: 1 analysis, limited pricing details.\n• Premium (Unlimited):\n• Weekly: $4.99\n• Annual: $29.99\n• Lifetime: $39.99\n(Prices may vary by region. Subscriptions auto-renew; manage or cancel anytime in your iOS Settings.)\nLinks\n• Terms of Use: https://bglab.app/p/app_d123b10af9a312500898f51612996920/terms\n• Privacy Policy: https://bglab.app/p/app_d123b10af9a3125008